//! 设置页：输出设备、麦克风、虚拟线缆、热键、关于。输出与麦克风的唯一可编辑入口在这里。

import { ComboBox, CheckBox, ScrollView } from "std-widgets.slint";
import { SliderRow } from "../components/slider-row.slint";
import { Theme } from "../theme.slint";
import { Card } from "../components/card.slint";
import { PmButton } from "../components/button.slint";
import { HotkeyField } from "../components/hotkey-field.slint";

export component SettingsPage inherits Rectangle {
    in-out property <[string]> devices: [];
    in-out property <int> device-index: 0;
    in-out property <[bool]> device-selected: [];
    in-out property <bool> all-devices: false;
    in-out property <bool> show-set-default-mic: false;
    in-out property <bool> set-default-mic: false;
    in-out property <bool> set-default-render: false;
    in-out property <bool> set-default-communications: false;
    in-out property <string> dest-hint: "";
    in-out property <[string]> mics: [];
    in-out property <int> mic-index: 0;
    in-out property <bool> running: false;
    in-out property <bool> cable-installed: false;
    in-out property <bool> cable-busy: false;
    in-out property <string> cable-text: "";
    in-out property <string> hotkey-label: "";
    in-out property <bool> listening-hotkey: false;
    in-out property <string> playback-key-label: "未设置";
    in-out property <int> playback-key-mode: 0;
    in-out property <bool> preview-enabled: false;
    in-out property <float> preview-volume: 50;
    in-out property <string> about-text: "";
    callback refresh();
    callback install-cable();
    callback begin-hotkey-capture();
    callback reset-hotkey();
    callback all-devices-toggled(bool);
    callback device-toggled(int, bool);
    callback set-default-mic-toggled(bool);
    callback set-default-render-toggled(bool);
    callback set-default-communications-toggled(bool);
    callback playback-key-mode-toggled(int);
    callback preview-enabled-toggled(bool);
    callback preview-volume-edited(float);
    background: transparent;

    ScrollView {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;

        VerticalLayout {
            padding: Theme.padPage;
            spacing: Theme.gapLg;

            Card {
                HorizontalLayout {
                    Text {
                        text: "输出与虚拟线缆";
                        color: Theme.text2;
                        font-size: 12px;
                        font-weight: 600;
                        vertical-alignment: TextVerticalAlignment.center;
                    }
                    Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; background: transparent; }
                    Text {
                        text: root.cable-installed ? "VB-CABLE 已安装" : root.cable-text;
                        color: root.cable-installed ? Theme.ok : Theme.text2;
                        font-size: 12px;
                        font-weight: 600;
                        vertical-alignment: TextVerticalAlignment.center;
                    }
                    if !root.cable-installed: PmButton {
                        label: root.cable-busy ? "安装中…" : "安装 VB-CABLE";
                        enabled: !root.cable-busy;
                        clicked => { root.install-cable(); }
                    }
                }
                Text { text: "输出设备（可多选）"; color: Theme.text2; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
                VerticalLayout {
                    for name[index] in root.devices: CheckBox {
                        text: name;
                        checked: index < root.device-selected.length ? root.device-selected[index] : false;
                        enabled: !root.running;
                        toggled => { root.device-toggled(index, self.checked); }
                    }
                }
                PmButton { label: "刷新设备"; enabled: !root.running; clicked => { root.refresh(); } }
                CheckBox {
                    text: "显示全部播放设备（含物理扬声器）";
                    checked <=> root.all-devices;
                    enabled: !root.running;
                    toggled => { root.all-devices-toggled(self.checked); }
                }
                if root.show-set-default-mic: CheckBox {
                    text: "设为默认麦克风（停止转发后还原）";
                    checked <=> root.set-default-mic;
                    enabled: !root.running;
                    toggled => { root.set-default-mic-toggled(self.checked); }
                }
                CheckBox { text: "设为系统默认播放设备"; checked <=> root.set-default-render; enabled: !root.running; toggled => { root.set-default-render-toggled(self.checked); } }
                CheckBox { text: "设为默认通信播放设备"; checked <=> root.set-default-communications; enabled: !root.running; toggled => { root.set-default-communications-toggled(self.checked); } }
                Text {
                    text: root.dest-hint;
                    color: Theme.text2;
                    font-size: 12px;
                    wrap: word-wrap;
                }
            }

            Card {
                Text {
                    text: "混入麦克风";
                    color: Theme.text2;
                    font-size: 12px;
                    font-weight: 600;
                }
                ComboBox {
                    model: root.mics;
                    current-index <=> root.mic-index;
                    enabled: !root.running;
                }
                Text {
                    text: "物理麦克风会被混进同一条输出。要「我说话 + 音效一起进游戏」，就在游戏里把麦克风选成这只虚拟麦的录音端。";
                    color: Theme.text3;
                    font-size: 12px;
                    wrap: word-wrap;
                }
            }

            Card {
                Text {
                    text: "热键";
                    color: Theme.text2;
                    font-size: 12px;
                    font-weight: 600;
                }
                HotkeyField {
                    label: "开始/停止转发";
                    combo: root.hotkey-label;
                    listening: root.listening-hotkey;
                    begin => { root.begin-hotkey-capture(); }
                    reset => { root.reset-hotkey(); }
                }
                Text {
                    text: "捕获方式（仅系统热键 / 全局钩子 / 关闭）与风险提示在后续阶段实装。";
                    color: Theme.text3;
                    font-size: 12px;
                    wrap: word-wrap;
                }
                Text { text: "播放时按键（全局）"; color: Theme.text2; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
                HorizontalLayout {
                    spacing: 8px;
                    ComboBox {
                        horizontal-stretch: 1;
                        model: ["不按键", "播放开始按一次", "播放期间一直按"];
                        current-index <=> root.playback-key-mode;
                        enabled: !root.running;
                        selected(_) => { root.playback-key-mode-toggled(root.playback-key-mode); }
                    }
                    Text { text: root.playback-key-label; color: Theme.text2; font-size: 12px; vertical-alignment: TextVerticalAlignment.center; }
                }
                Text {
                    text: "全局生效：双击音频后按一次或保持按下，用于游戏 PTT。默认不按键；启用输入模拟时需注意反作弊与权限风险。";
                    color: Theme.text3;
                    font-size: 12px;
                    wrap: word-wrap;
                }
            }

            Card {
                Text { text: "本地预览"; color: Theme.text2; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
                CheckBox { text: "播放音频时同时在本机预览"; checked <=> root.preview-enabled; enabled: !root.running; toggled => { root.preview-enabled-toggled(self.checked); } }
                SliderRow { label: "预览音量"; value <=> root.preview-volume; enabled: root.preview-enabled; edited(v) => { root.preview-volume-edited(v); } }
                Text { text: "预览声音只送到本机默认播放设备，不进入虚拟麦克风；默认关闭。"; color: Theme.text3; font-size: 12px; wrap: word-wrap; }
            }
            Card {
                Text {
                    text: "关于";
                    color: Theme.text2;
                    font-size: 12px;
                    font-weight: 600;
                }
                Text {
                    text: root.about-text;
                    color: Theme.text2;
                    font-size: 12px;
                    wrap: word-wrap;
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
